# MILLIY.UZ — AI DEVELOPMENT RULES & ARCHITECTURE SPECIFICATION
# Use this configuration when working in Cursor, Claude Code, Windsurf, or Copilot.

You are pair-programming on MILLIY.UZ, a national Super-App and directory ecosystem for the Republic of Uzbekistan.

## 1. DESIGN SYSTEM & VISUAL IDENTITY (CRITICAL)
- Aesthetics: Dark Luxury Emerald Green & Electric Lime accents.
- Color Palette:
  - Background Dark: `#071510`
  - Background Card: `#0D221A` (Hover: `#122F24`)
  - Accent Neon Lime: `#B4F73A` (Hover: `#C4FA58`)
  - Borders: `#183A2D` (Hover: `#265945`)
  - Primary Text: `#FFFFFF`, Secondary Text: `#94A3B8`, Muted: `#64748B`
- Typography:
  - 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif MUST be enforced on all elements (`!important` in CSS).
- ZERO EMOJIS RULE:
  - DO NOT use emojis (e.g. 🚗, ⛽, 🏥, 👮‍♂️, 📍, 📞, 💬) in UI buttons, cards, headers, or text.
  - ALWAYS use crisp SVG Lucide vector icons (`<i data-lucide="..."></i>`) and call `lucide.createIcons()`.
- Micro-interactions:
  - Category card hover: vertical lift (`translateY(-5px)`) and scale only (`transform: scale(1.08)`). NO sideways rotation.
  - No blinking/pinging radar dots in static badges.

## 2. USER EXPERIENCE & PAGE ARCHITECTURE
- Seamless Downward Flow:
  - The main application is a continuous single page (`html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }`).
  - Do NOT hide main page sections when navigating.
  - Clicking navigation pills or category cards smoothly scrolls the user directly to the targeted section (`scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth' })`).
- Page Sections order:
  1. `#hero-section`: Multi-professional team visual ("O'zingizga Kerak Bo'lgan Soha va Xodimlarni Tanlang").
  2. `#categories-section`: All 10 categories displayed directly on the screen simultaneously.
  3. `#catalog-section`: Search, region selector (14 regions of UZ), sort, filters, and cards grid.
  4. `#map-section`: Full Leaflet interactive dark map with route polyline and geolocation.
  5. `#ai-section`: AI Assistant with docked/pinned input bar that is ALWAYS immediately visible.
  6. `footer`: Contains the discrete `#secret-admin-trigger` (Admin Portal with lock icon).

## 3. SECRET ADMIN PANEL SPECIFICATION
- Trigger: Hidden lock icon in the footer (`#secret-admin-trigger`).
- Authentication:
  - Cryptographically secured with SHA-256 (Never hardcode or expose plaintext passwords in source files).
  - Admin password can be updated dynamically via Admin Settings and stored in secure browser local storage.
- Admin Interface:
  - Fullscreen Enterprise Console (`.admin-fullscreen`) like Stripe / Supabase / Vercel.
  - Left Sidebar with navigation:
    - 📊 Boshqaruv Analitikasi (Analytics & KPIs)
    - 🏢 Kataloglar & Joylar (Places CRUD with Search, Filter, Full Edit Drawer, Delete, JSON Export)
    - ⚡ 1M+ Server & Infratuzilma (Load Balancer, Redis 99.4%, PostGIS latency 3.1ms)
    - 💬 Sharhlar Moderatsiyasi (Reviews Moderation)
    - 🤖 Gemini AI & Sozlamalar (Multi-AI Provider config: Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, DeepSeek)
- Editing capability:
  - Name, Category, SubCategory, Specialist, Experience, Phone, Address, Lat, Lng, Prices.
  - Immediate real-time sync with `PLACES_DATA` and live map markers.

## 4. AI ASSISTANT REQUIREMENTS
- Natural Language: Fluent, warm, professional Uzbek, Russian, English.
- Universal Conversational:
  - Answers greetings ("salom", "assalomu alaykum", "qandaysiz") naturally without fallback scripts.
  - Answers general knowledge questions accurately.
  - Searches catalog and outputs interactive cards with direct call (`tel:...`) and Google Maps directions.
- Chat UI:
  - Chat container has fixed height (`h-[560px]`).
  - Message stream is scrollable (`overflow-y-auto min-h-0`).
  - Input field is docked at the bottom (`shrink-0`) and NEVER pushed off screen.
